"""Deterministic checks for the rack power-cap compile.

The verifier container holds no source directory, so the shipped sources and an
unseen fleet of the same layout are embedded below together with the expected
tables. Later stages are graded on upstream directories built here, never on the
agent's own upstream output. Every run of the delivered program happens once, in
a fixed order, inside one locked preparation step, because rewardkit evaluates
criteria on several threads at once. Negative checks hold when the cheat they name
happened.
"""

